{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\r\n\t\t\t油塘油麗邨發生火警，導致至少兩人受傷，其中一人送往聯合醫院救治。<br/>\n<br/>\r\n警方上午近11時接獲多人報警，指油麗邨秀麗樓一個單位起火，約100人自行疏散，消防員到場出動一條喉及一煙帽隊撲救，約半小時後將火救熄。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\r\n編輯：黃佩珊\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-15T07:47:35.911689+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":107,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T03:58:13+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-15T10:38:02.910232+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-15T07:41:08.469027+00:00","content_hash":"69f8fce8c7e8a7a66ad8a6f1850d9e2bac8b46ab2299dc47756cd2db1bb2ed0d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}